Package: dicto
Version: 0.0.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mohammadreza Khani <mohamadkhani14@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/logi-camp/dicto
Description: Fast, offline desktop dictionary for MDX/MDD files
 Dicto is a native desktop dictionary that reads MDX/MDD files (the
 GoldenDict / MDict format) with instant search, faithful per-dictionary
 CSS rendering, multi-dictionary management, and a built-in dictionary
 downloader. Built in Rust on GPUI.
 .
 The Depends field is generated by packaging/debian/build-deb.sh from
 the actual shared libraries the shipped binary requires, including a
 verified libc6 floor derived from the binary's symbol versions.
